---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Start a website, software, automation or managed-service conversation with Blackline Development.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Start a project</p>
        <h1>Tell us what needs to work better.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          You do not need a finished specification. Start with the outcome, the problem, what you already have and anything you know must not change.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-aside">
        <strong>Intake connection pending</strong>
        <p>The public project-intake and email handoff will be connected as a separately governed integration before production launch.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split-panel">
      <article class="panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Useful starting information</p>
        <h3>What are you trying to achieve?</h3>
        <p>
          Useful context includes the desired result, who will use it, what exists today, any deadlines or dependencies, and the parts you are unsure about. Unknowns are allowed.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Next phase</p>
        <h3>Guided discovery without the giant form.</h3>
        <p>
          A later approved site capability will support live guided questionnaires that help clients work through requirements conversationally before human review.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
